{"id":"en_a-will-a-wedding-and-a-big-mistake","title":"A Will, a Wedding, and a Big Mistake!","titleEn":"A Will, a Wedding, and a Big Mistake!","description":"Summer was raised to think her family had nothing, a story her sisters maintained to honor their late father's final request. Everything shifts when she marries a wealthy businessman in order to rescue his struggling company. What she still doesn't realize is that a sizable inheritance is actually hers, and her sisters now have to keep up the pretense of poverty while quietly watching over the money she has no idea exists. The arrangement leaves them guarding both a secret and a fortune as Summer's new marriage unfolds.","poster":"https://cdn1.nsstorage.space/a-will-a-wedding-and-a-big-mistake/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn1.nsstorage.space/a-will-a-wedding-and-a-big-mistake/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Strong Female Lead","Urban","Love After Marriage","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dkooa/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_a-will-a-wedding-and-a-big-mistake_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dkooa/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_a-will-a-wedding-and-a-big-mistake_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dkooa/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_a-will-a-wedding-and-a-big-mistake_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dkooa/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_a-will-a-wedding-and-a-big-mistake_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"s